** The WHM will also heal and buff ??? in addition to debuffing your party.
* When you engage ???, it will rarely move from it's position. Instead, it will opt for using ranged attacks on the person with hate if they happen to be out of melee range.
* If you stand in melee range, ??? will use its sword, along with a wide variety of weapon skills on you. It is a fairly straightforward battle until ??? uses {p:Meikyo Shisui}.
* ??? can and will skillchain on you and it can use {p:Meikyo Shisui} multiple times.
